# Generated files are outputs, not sources (METHOD.md rule 1), and `nopekit pack
# export` ships this directory — a tracked evidence file would travel with the pack
# and read as part of it while being stale from whenever it was last written.
#
# `nopekit gate selftest` writes its evidence here, and every gate's `evidence`
# paths point into ctx.out_dir, so this is scratch by construction.
.selftest-out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
